    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "In the end, it still fell to me.",
        "zh": "“事情终究还是落到了我身上。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "They said I’m now capable of presiding over the ritual on my own.",
        "zh": "他们说，我已经可以独自主持仪式了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "They said I would become the youngest priestess in the Shen family.",
        "zh": "他们说，我会成为沈家最年轻的祭司。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Now I understand.",
        "zh": "现在的我明白了，",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "People have to learn to accept what they are meant to bear.",
        "zh": "人总要学会接受自己该承担的东西。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Those rules, those rituals, those things passed down from one generation to the next,",
        "zh": "那些规矩、那些仪式、那些一代代传下来的东西，",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "since they were always meant to be inherited by me,",
        "zh": "既然注定要由我继承，",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "then I shouldn’t run from them any longer.",
        "zh": "那我就不该再逃了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Not everyone is worthy of understanding what this means,",
        "zh": "不是所有人都配理解这份意义，",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "and not everyone has the right to come near it.",
        "zh": "也不是所有人都有资格靠近它。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "...From now on,",
        "zh": "……从今以后，",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "I won’t doubt anymore.",
        "zh": "我不会再怀疑了。”",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_恐惧",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "How did Noema get tangled up in something like this...?",
        "zh": "梦之她，怎么会和这些事扯上关系……",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Thinking back on everything that happened on the plane last night, none of it feels right.",
        "zh": "昨晚飞机上发生的一切，现在想起来，实在太不对劲了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "No. I can’t jump to conclusions based on just these few pages.",
        "zh": "不对，我不能只凭这几张纸就下结论。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "I need to ask her about all of this face to face.",
        "zh": "这些事，我一定要当面问清楚。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 1
    },
